    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field trip gone WRONG?\u00a0</strong>Stumbled into a spine-tingling forest where mythic beasts lurk?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herb-hunting disaster?</strong> Now you\u2019re face-to-face with a <strong>giant crimson legendary monster</strong>?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the academy\u2019s <strong>rising pharmacy star</strong>, you\u2019re destined to triumph\u2026 until\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWait\u2014where\u2019s my herb pouch? How do I even mix potions now\uff1fWhy can't I remember anything??!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Believe in us! We've got this!&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POOF!</strong> Your genius? Gone. All that\u2019s left? Panic and a sword-crazy warrior buddy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/a40ed007a6020ced699345d205d57a1b.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into our hand-drawn picture-book world\u2014crafted with love! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cozy corner tells a story! Unwrap our tale and enjoy this adorable adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/a9ec12da6bad6fe9683a4fb0da9057fa.poster.avif?t=1750999789\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/a9ec12da6bad6fe9683a4fb0da9057fa.webm?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/a9ec12da6bad6fe9683a4fb0da9057fa.mp4?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/6031e3b0ec1e91871cb59356b1b955bc.avif?t=1750999789\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/39064dc412908fb09b1e91a90de9d133.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the materials obtained on the adventure, and based on the reactions of your partner and enemies after drinking the potion, figure out the effects of the herbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your herbal know-how while untangling all sorts of puzzles that come your way! No worries\u2014there\u2019s always a solution waiting to be found\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/07fe249d987de02c5abfdb771f23262a.poster.avif?t=1750999789\" width=672 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/07fe249d987de02c5abfdb771f23262a.webm?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/07fe249d987de02c5abfdb771f23262a.mp4?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/5e0063e97109087e73c6ba19b0a2063a.poster.avif?t=1750999789\" width=672 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/5e0063e97109087e73c6ba19b0a2063a.webm?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/5e0063e97109087e73c6ba19b0a2063a.mp4?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/f6ec6553c9d253dca9ba264233c28f9f.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing a puzzle? Play it safe to avoid nasty potion side-effects... or chase that wild surprise boost?\u00a0<br>Dose your buddy? Or lob it at a foe?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make isn't just about cracking puzzles\u2014it\u2019s about unlocking the secrets of every herb!\u00a0<br>So don\u2019t fear slip-ups! Experiment boldly!<br>After all\u2014it\u2019s all in the name of discovering the <strong>MAGIC</strong> in every mix!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/fcf15e704eac92a4f41d2a427e08d451.poster.avif?t=1750999789\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/fcf15e704eac92a4f41d2a427e08d451.webm?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/fcf15e704eac92a4f41d2a427e08d451.mp4?t=1750999789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/4601336ae5a1bca6525421da43d959ed.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find other adventurers along the way, are they friends or foes, and what are their goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a \u2018Friendship Potion\u2019 with them\u2014<br>Gulp!\u00a0<br>POOF! Their true colors can\u2019t hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the brew\u2014truth always bubbles up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/897e17f887bb1aca17e7c92d3cbeaaf3.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=623 /></span></p>",
