eight=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find other adventurers along the way, are they friends or foes, and what are their goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share a \u2018Friendship Potion\u2019 with them\u2014<br>Gulp!\u00a0<br>POOF! Their true colors can\u2019t hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the brew\u2014truth always bubbles up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/897e17f887bb1aca17e7c92d3cbeaaf3.avif?t=1750999789\" data-has-big width=800 height=623 /></span></p>",
